This project carries over code from OpenPuck
(https://github.com/safijari/openpuck), also AGPL-3.0, by the OpenPuck
authors and contributors. The reverse-engineered Steam Controller 2 RF
protocol, the radio driver, bonding, and the USB plumbing are their work.

Carried over from OpenPuck, with LizardKing's modifications (other emulation
modes, the WebUSB configurator, firmware update over WebUSB, Xbox 360 console
authentication and dynamic USB mounting removed):

  LizardKing/bonds.*, board_config.h, build_info.h, config.*,
  controllers.*, fault_diag.*, gamepad_util.*, haptics.*, identity.*,
  lizard_map.*, mode_lizard.*, mode_xinput.*, puck_hid.*, pwr_switch.*,
  radio.*, rf_diag.*, rf_journal_layout.h, rf_link.*, serial_console.*,
  status_led.*, steam_commands.h, triton.*, usb_app_drivers.*, usb_tx.*,
  wake_hid.*, xinput_descriptors.h, LizardKing.ino (from OpenPuck.ino),
  gen_version.sh, .clang-format, docs/PROTOCOL.md

Written for LizardKing:

  LizardKing/mode_lizardking.*, LizardKing/guide_drive.*, guide/, tools/layout/,
  tools/check-trailing-comments.py, docs/DESIGN.md,
  docs/KEYBOARD_LAYOUT.md
